{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210300-i-got-the-can-t-afford-the-dragonblooded-kickstarter-blues","id":1210300,"title":"I got the Can't afford the Dragonblooded Kickstarter Blues...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-22T23:21:59-07:00","id":1210300,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> I got the Can't afford the Dragonblooded Kickstarter Blues...","content":"Uhhh I had money set aside for the Dragonblooded kickstarter for like a year... and when it comes out I can't back it more then the minimum to read the manuscript. I had to pay for an emergency root canal without insurance, and have been paying off a 2k+ vet bill from December (which turned out unnecessary but the vet was squeezing 2k worth of fruitless surgery and treatment because he knew I was worried, and it turns out they just needed to treat my cat for a urinary tract infection), and now ugghh I won't have the money till two days after the kickstarter ends. Seriously I feel the Kickstarters hear have the worst timing, intentionally worse timing you demons!<br /> <br /> Oh well I am glad it worked out. Ugghh I feel like kicking myself. Please tell me others are feeling the blues for this too. :'(","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T23:33:53-07:00","id":1210304,"title":"","content":"Check your inbox","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T00:18:02-07:00","id":1210317,"title":"","content":"You know that KS doesn\u2019t take the funds until it ends, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T04:22:13-07:00","id":1210361,"title":"","content":"A very generous person helped me be able to back the KS, but for a while, I was in a boat very similar to yours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T10:29:14-07:00","id":1210478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210300-i-got-the-can-t-afford-the-dragonblooded-kickstarter-blues#post1210300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...and have been paying off a 2k+ vet bill from December (which turned out unnecessary but the vet was squeezing 2k worth of fruitless surgery and treatment because he knew I was worried, and it turns out they just needed to treat my cat for a urinary tract infection)...</div> </div> </div> </div>I am super not a lawyer, but this sounds like the kind of thing that's, you know, illegal. And fraudulent. If I were you, I'd consider talking to the local Veterinary Medical Board or other licensing agency -- the threat of losing their license might make the vet in question inclined to refund you for the unnecessary procedures.<br /> <br /> (Or, you know, talk to an actual lawyer and not some Internet weirdo. It just seems like you must have *some* recourse here. Because there's no way that's above-board.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7058-kerredai","name":"Kerredai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T10:32:06-07:00","id":1210481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210300-i-got-the-can-t-afford-the-dragonblooded-kickstarter-blues?p=1210317#post1210317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know that KS doesn\u2019t take the funds until it ends, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>He did say he wouldn't be able to get the money until after it ended.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T11:23:27-07:00","id":1210499,"title":"","content":"I think Kickstarter assumes that you\u2019ll be paying by credit card, so you should have a month to pay that off after they charge you. <br /> <br /> Also, I\u2019m not sure how they handle it if you pledge and your credit card or whatever doesn\u2019t have sufficient funds, but I think there\u2019s a grace period of a few days before they cancel your pledge. They probably say on the KS site.<br /> <br /> Alternately, if you can scrape up 5$, you\u2019ll be in the Kickstarter and you\u2019ll be able to add more items via Backerkit later. And they shouldn\u2019t start doing that for a couple weeks, maybe a month.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T13:06:07-07:00","id":1210557,"title":"","content":"A generous backer is letting me piggy back on a pledge and pay when the funds come in. Sometimes this community can shine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kerredai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210300-i-got-the-can-t-afford-the-dragonblooded-kickstarter-blues?p=1210478#post1210478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am super not a lawyer, but this sounds like the kind of thing that's, you know, illegal. And fraudulent. If I were you, I'd consider talking to the local Veterinary Medical Board or other licensing agency -- the threat of losing their license might make the vet in question inclined to refund you for the unnecessary procedures.<br /> <br /> (Or, you know, talk to an actual lawyer and not some Internet weirdo. It just seems like you must have *some* recourse here. Because there's no way that's above-board.)</div> </div> </div> </div>It felt unsavory I came in because my cat got sick thanksgiving weekend and didn\u2019t go to the bathroom for a week. They told me to wait for a day and they would call me with test results, they didn\u2019t call the next day so I went in the day after. They noticed blockage in the bowels and bladder and since I checked the box saying my pet is my family they took the cat in to do stomach surgery biopsy. They got Chopper, my tiny cat, to urinate but kept her to see if she had stomach cancer because they thought her stomach had tumors. I couldn\u2019t afford it and had to get a friend to sign up for this medical thing called care credit which is like a medica credit card to pay for 2k of the estimated surgery and hospitalization costs or they wouldn\u2019t let me take my cat home. It really felt like they had me by the balls since my cat was sick and in there care. I was tired and working overtime sometimes getting home from work after 3am and going to the vet when they opened at 8am. I even called in my only sick day for the surgery while I was exhausted that day.<br /> <br /> Luckily Choppers tumors came off as benign, they retested because the doc really wanted them to be cancer because that would explain things, and meant more mulah. Chopper is really tiny, the doc thought she was a 2 month old when she is five years old. It seems she is Likely so tiny because of a born stomach deformity as I adopted her when she was a couple weeks old and was a parking lot kitten. So I was relieved she didn\u2019t have cancer and decided to take a mulligan on the costs since she was okay. But they never exactly found out why she got a urinary tract infection and a stomach irritation. We believe maybe she ate something rough like maybe trash and it upset her stomach combine with being in heat caused her not to urinate.<br /> <br /> I was terrified when she was sick for a week, not eating and hiding and finally resting on my stomach acting scared and week like she was dying. But if the vets knew what they were doing it should have cost me less then 300 for simple urinary tract infection treatment. Instead it was almost 3 grand and my cat had to stay terrified in the clinic away from home get iv\u2019a and a neck cone from surgery as well as being fed nutrient gruel from a mouth injector. I think they are very covered due to the papers I signed but it really felt shady that they held my cat hostage unless I paid them upfront. And then they kept her in hospitalization until they used up every bit of the funds paid in advance. I shan\u2019t likely go back to those vets.<br /> <br /> Luckily the Local dental college is cheaper then local dentists because I didn\u2019t want to remove a tooth at my age because I couldn\u2019t pay. I got a free consultation visit from another dentist and they insisted I do everything through them even though I didn\u2019t have insurance and they would have had to pull the tooth. They even knew the dental college could help me but didn\u2019t tell me about them even though they could save my tooth. And all this happened after moving so I paid lease fees, otherwise I could have paid for the vet from my savings, and I could have paid for the dentist if I didn\u2019t have a vet bill!<br /> <br /> But look at me rant! It\u2019s well now, I can back the project. And I can buy time on this temporary root canal filling till I get the money for a tooth cap. Yay me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T16:38:50-07:00","id":1210676,"title":"","content":"Our community wins again! Look forward to enjoying the book alongside you <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a>. ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}